1
00:00:05,950 --> 00:00:09,400
[Music]

2
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:11,480
She could have flown us out of here.

3
00:00:09,400 --> 00:00:13,520
Yeah, I'm sure.

4
00:00:11,480 --> 00:00:16,720
You know, she's cursed.

5
00:00:13,520 --> 00:00:19,200
She burned her last master alive.

6
00:00:16,720 --> 00:00:23,040
Put your worries aside, boy.

7
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:23,040
That just means she still works.

8
00:00:27,540 --> 00:00:30,660
[Music]

9
00:00:30,760 --> 00:00:35,680
I don't like this.

10
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:39,000
Sitting out here in this wretched place.

11
00:00:35,680 --> 00:00:39,000
We need to get back to the others.

12
00:00:42,800 --> 00:00:47,240
We just have to survive the night.

13
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:48,720
In the morning we can get to the docks.

14
00:00:47,240 --> 00:00:52,000
Hook will be there.

15
00:00:48,720 --> 00:00:52,000
He's waited too long for her.

16
00:00:52,250 --> 00:00:55,509
[Applause]

17
00:00:57,060 --> 00:01:00,159
[Music]

18
00:01:05,640 --> 00:01:10,400
Hey Tink. It's been a long time.

19
00:01:10,560 --> 00:01:17,560
Where are the other lost boys?

20
00:01:13,640 --> 00:01:17,560
There are no more lost boys.

21
00:01:17,840 --> 00:01:21,200
Come on.

22
00:01:19,080 --> 00:01:22,920
It's time to go. We're going to see

23
00:01:21,200 --> 00:01:26,450
Peter?

24
00:01:22,920 --> 00:01:32,489
He's not here anymore either, Tink.

25
00:01:26,450 --> 00:01:32,489
[Music]

